From 87504fee6ffbb4cab22f45dd290dc17f1eb861cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:14:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v0.8.5: eight-step filter, camera tilt range, look-up rain,
 VU1 statistics

The filter replay keeps up to eight writes (one AREA 03 version has eight).
PS2_CAMERA_PITCH takes '@' and the camera block's address, and notes once
when it widens the range. Lens rain reads the camera block directly and
gets heavier when the view looks up. PS2_VU1_STATS=1 counts VU1 programs by
code image and start address.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
